@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/drafts/
actor "Der Client" as Client
participant "- Überwacher RestAlchemy" as API
database "Zeile der Entwürfe in PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Internes Domänenname outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\ninternal/no public derivative" as TASK
Client -> API: POST JSON Entwurf
API -> DB: BEGIN; Eigentümer + Thema überprüfen
API -> DB: Einfügen oder vergleichen von Client- UUID
API -> OUT: Hinzufügen von draft.created
API -> DB: COMMIT
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
note right of TASK: effect guard; ohne zu beenden public event row
API --> Client: 201 oder impotent 200 + ETag
@enduml
